    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b1807c844fa1b52",
      "translationZh": "Feng, Jiazhan 等。Retool：面向大语言模型策略性工具使用的强化学习。arXiv 预印本 arXiv:2504.11536（2025）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
